{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy looping street where each pass has a chance to have an audiovisual anomaly. Players must decide to go forward if they haven't spotted, or go back if they have spotted an anomaly in the current pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO DESCRIPTION:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 20% of anomalies from the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player starts at loop 16 and finishes the demo when loop 9 is reached<br>(wishlist the full game to continue from loop 9 and finish the game when it comes out)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 15-20 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/extras/5fdd2ee321e9d9210d6d637f5f1ec974.poster.avif?t=1758646595\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/extras/5fdd2ee321e9d9210d6d637f5f1ec974.webm?t=1758646595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/extras/5fdd2ee321e9d9210d6d637f5f1ec974.mp4?t=1758646595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong> <br>W/A/S/D = move <br>Shift = run <br>Space = jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.poster.avif?t=1758646595\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.webm?t=1758646595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.mp4?t=1758646595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final words from the developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made with love. I created it because I genuinely enjoy anomaly detection walking simulators. The Exit 8 and Shinkansen 0 were major inspirations, and I wanted to build something in that spirit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034900?t=1758646595","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/1865a7cd9063108f1f54e576cda8d941b944e840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758646595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/cdc3e4919a9fc19813e1a936a73369fc5c48c7e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758646595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034900/cdc3e4919a9fc19813e1a936a73369fc5c48c7e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758646595","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy looping street where each pass has a chance to have an audiovisual anomaly. Players must decide to go forward if they haven't spotted, or go back if they have spotted an anomaly in the current pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO DESCRIPTION:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 20% of anomalies from the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player starts at loop 16 and finishes the demo when loop 9 is reached<br>